## Implementation Checklist by Layer

| Layer | Tool / Service | Typical Configuration |
|-------|----------------|-----------------------|
| **Ingress** | API Gateway (Kong, Apigee, AWS API Gateway) | TLS termination, rate limits, IP whitelisting |
| **Auth** | OAuth2 Provider (Keycloak, Auth0, Azure AD B2C) | PKCE, short access token TTL, RBAC scopes |
| **Runtime** | Service Mesh (Istio, Linkerd) | mTLS, circuit breaking, observability |
| **Data** | Database (PostgreSQL, MongoDB) | Field encryption, row‑level security |
| **Secrets** | Vault | Dynamic database credentials, auto‑rotate keys |
| **Observability** | Prometheus + Grafana, Loki + Grafana, Elastic APM | Dashboards for auth failures, throttling |
| **Security** | OWASP ZAP, Snyk, Trivy | Continuous scanning in CI pipeline |

